        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_pro/scenes/missions/wet/scene_rat_basic.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository dda2781b-ff82-482a-bf5c-bb5cedf9dd28).Image",
        "Description": "Good evening 47,\r\rA terrorist known only as &apos;The Vanguard&apos; has attacked the ICA. They have dispatched several of their group to the ICA facility in Chongqing, China. These men are attempting to infiltrate the facility, and leak critical information on our agency. This cannot happen. Elimate these terrorists, preferably with a sniper rifle. \r\rOnce they are taken care of, we can start work on finding out who The Vanguard really is.\r\rHappy hunting, 47.",
